                        /// Test 5: Constant ability recalculation — heart gain persists during live.
                        ///
                        /// Setup:
                        ///   - Two live cards collectively covering all 6 heart types
                        ///   - Setsuna on stage
                        ///   - Pass multiple times through performance phase
                        ///
